(Inventory management supports scheduled and spot physical counting sessions \(INV-YYYY-XXXXXX\). The system freezes theoretical stock at) Tj
T* (session opening, compares it against field counts, and automatically computes quantitative variances \(Surplus/Deficit\) and financial variances) Tj
T* (valorized at current WAC/CMP. Validating the session creates balancing stock movements and records an audit log entry.) Tj
ET
