(Provenda includes a built-in POS thermal receipt printer driver supporting both 58 mm and 80 mm thermal paper formats. The driver connects with) Tj
T* (the Windows print spooler, USB and network receipt printers, and the native Electron desktop bridge. Every printed receipt includes the corporate) Tj
T* (logo, store header, tax credentials, itemized quantities and prices, payment methods, cash tender change calculation, and an official Code 39) Tj
T* (barcode.) Tj
